              <p class="text-[14px] text-ed-dark/60 mt-3 leading-relaxed">A sun-kissed blend of ancient grains, creamy feta, and crisp vegetables with herb vinaigrette.</p>
              <p class="font-cardinal text-ed-green text-[20px] mt-4">14.90&euro;</p>
              <div class="flex gap-3 mt-4">
                <a href="https://elledees.zelty-order.fr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex-1 h-[40px] flex items-center justify-center bg-ed-green text-white text-[12px] font-geomanist-bold uppercase tracking-wide rounded-full hover:bg-ed-green/90 transition-colors">Order</a>
                <button type="button" onclick="toggleNutrition(this)" class="flex-1 h-[40px] flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-ed-green text-ed-green text-[12px] font-geomanist-bold uppercase tracking-wide rounded-full hover:bg-ed-green/5 transition-colors">Nutrition Info</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="nutrition-panel absolute inset-0 bg-ed-beige rounded-xl p-5 pt-0 md:p-6 md:pt-0 translate-y-full transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex flex-col">
