              <span class="font-cardinal text-ed-green text-[18px] md:text-[48px]">13.90</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[18px] font-geomanist-bold tracking-wider text-ed-dark mt-1 uppercase">Honey-Mustard Dressing</p>
            <p class="text-[12px] text-ed-dark mt-1.5 leading-relaxed uppercase font-geomanist-bold">Avocado, raw broccoli florets, sun-dried tomatoes, crispy pitas, sunflower seeds, arugula, batavia</p>
